!-   ===========  ALL OBJECTS IN CLASS: SIZING:SYSTEM ===========

Sizing:System,
    Suite ERVs,              !- AirLoop Name
    VentilationRequirement,  !- Type of Load to Size On
    autosize,                !- Design Outdoor Air Flow Rate {m3/s}
